{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物每一步选择背后的动机，以及前后情节之间的因果承接，交代得不如Y充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词突出，叙述简洁，感受文字有大小层次和音乐时点控制，普通观众可以先抓住故事要点，再在音乐推进时接收细腻的情绪变化。Y的优势是人物心理动机和前后因果讲得更完整，但左侧长句与右侧大量短词同时出现，部分段落的信息负担较重，而且一些感受词偏直白、概念化。综合边听边扫的实际体验，我选X：它更容易让人及时抓住故事，同时保留感受的细腻度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "65be39ed-b701-4645-8fe7-1d306f6188ad", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T015743463627Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T01:58:33.497880+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6dff5d0e0fdafb88b0a3a3036c979eabd95f7459dc72907bdd1b7139c7d0a6a9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23